#API call for listing heros
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/heros/
Accept:application/json


#API call for adding heros
###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/heros/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"Spiderman",
    "real_name":"peter parker",
    "gender":"Male",
    "powers":"Web slinging,spider sense",
    "universe":"Marvel"
}



#API call for retrieving heros
###
GET  http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/heros/4/
